      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "锅里的咖喱还冒着热气，四个人再也没能回家。",
      "sha256": "47f67060b9747e2d1e20b7f42b61971532d9dc64987c329c5ce45834c4c01059",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "那天一早，园部的主妇们就在车库里架起这口大锅，煮了整整一天。",
      "sha256": "81c25aad3fe34dd4a0b7ac6981c17ca9151063a9de3a88d26be12d3de521ec14",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "开饭的时候，主妇们一勺一勺把咖喱盛进餐盘，队伍一直排到街口。",
      "sha256": "94974f1198ba956438a8f430a2fb59f38811c44fd178131da2e5f85fc3368714",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "孩子挨着妈妈坐下，捧着自己的小盘子，一口一口吃得很香。",
      "sha256": "1d42bf53dfe621d03de3e223ff8c1b9475109e98b73f4a28642732bb8cc0f7fb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "夕阳落下去，蝉声很响，没有人察觉任何异常。",
      "sha256": "9422fb8526f209403f2cd4a6dc2b39e47a6c902bffd1f6404bc358e6bc3057c0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "大人们围坐在折叠桌旁，慢慢吃着咖喱聊着家常，谁也没有在意。",
      "sha256": "2bb6dab4aca7461a3cf1546ee6cf573425e44e69ba8e7d2d068cd552a152a1d3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "没过多久，有人扶住额头慢慢蹲了下去；接着，一个，又一个。",
      "sha256": "aa243e7d7e75b8ee71e53bc0d38a08b3161ad13305db2811b2d14bda89100a74",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "一辆接一辆的救护车挤进窄街，警灯在墙上不停打转。",
      "sha256": "7a65cb00338a3062c26ed2a1ebabdf3b478729555751b599555090fa6f12871b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "医生起初以为，这只是夏天常见的一次食物中毒。",
      "sha256": "20c4a97ffb26445c8b59920e83da76c185563fc622b340a293b1599400405d45",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "可症状越来越重：六十七人中毒，送进医院，四个人再没能救回来。",
      "sha256": "d9fefc1f1ccab26dda7a6381972475bbf886b1b9fccb837358f67be14b3a2706",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "检验结果出来了：让所有人中毒的，是砒霜，也就是亚砷酸。",
      "sha256": "8fce05d46b42628b905ae345acae4cc9a43c236a67c2a5121e25a0a4d153d909",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "毒物查明了：这不是意外，是有人故意把毒放进了那锅咖喱里。",
      "sha256": "a97f1c8c24c0f02c3487353954205b7dcdb5bac99a0d9406bdde93dff4e2ddde",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "全城震惊。警方在那口锅四周拉起警戒线。",
      "sha256": "861812cbac1d61a5e62f89dd9c88150b1e86fc5c7b113c8b0f956e8967888593",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "专案组围着板子推演：谁靠近过那口锅？谁有机会一个人留下？",
      "sha256": "0b58e3e3354dfa82b07e80cc21db91b546846f172978f48e58d81e982331b480",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "那天经过这条街、进过那间车库的每一张脸，全被重新排查一遍。",
      "sha256": "b0000af0e30091e2ba6fc5ed7c769cebcfa47e5b7023ee8dc8c26c3b666323de",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "照片钉上墙，红线牵着名字：谁在什么时候站在锅边。",
      "sha256": "0f337fd00d6c3e068b99dde409db9a3018e0a3758527d3a9e2aa9238b3a86693",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 99,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "街坊低声议论的，是同一个名字：林真须美。",
      "sha256": "6bec055c5961526cf16b3729cf0780d46a9849f7fdc1a9f707ac33e18f0c4aa5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 105,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "那年她三十七岁；和丈夫健治做过保险推销、灭白蚁，都碰过砷。",
      "sha256": "ae3ea8346ecd5e0147fff41808ee773cb8bd4c7214e42fe7749c06e745539523",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "警方在她家搜出一包白色粉末，送检之后，是和锅里同样的砷。",
      "sha256": "632a14d011d594912a2e1dfe76ac6bf0cb050d4b71998069eb5f644895fe1ef3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "案发之前那十年，夫妻俩多次靠保险诈骗，拿到过不少钱。",
      "sha256": "580d42e44b5ba274595c9f45dd72ace5267c29537d0d9812c92269c6cd26799e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "检方说：家里的砷和锅里的砷，成分相同。",
      "sha256": "946a6059dce9b2a41f12079b0d4d0c2139d1db251243bd7ec6e75b76b2ca4993",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "记者把她家门口围住；她抓起水管朝镜头猛喷，水花溅在镜片上。",
      "sha256": "d0a5050867ced0d8e8b987aee5bc3c257833fa4e471aab05ee115a5f6adbb34f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "这一幕当晚传遍全国。很多人看完那段画面，心里已经先给她定了罪。",
      "sha256": "c5d6c5b81cc9f5436e7b9a47cde035525632dd0f9f6c28968f48e0308e52ca3f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 142,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "同年十二月，她因这锅咖喱被捕。她只说：我没有做。",
      "sha256": "767ae0aa66ed559ddebeece643d194dfb7a0511bd947bc10137233949f8d3b18",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 149,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "2002年12月，和歌山地方法院一审宣判，判处她死刑。",
      "sha256": "6480c0d008aa928b533c288724b6ce95d8f05697f14381d9649c76c08af975ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 155,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "没有动机，也没有直接证据；法院靠的，只有鉴定和证词。",
      "sha256": "ce26e1b0b4a01f80d6254a2425d63e36992eebfd009867808ce6e7f617ea24a6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 161,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "2009年，最高法院维持死刑；辩方质疑证据。",
      "sha256": "77f844c19f520b54ba3cf0e878fbba32ad6a926b839bbd39a32438a82db5a8c8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 167,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "她至今在狱中喊冤，第三度再审仍在审理。你觉得，凶手是她吗？",
      "sha256": "33437f05b8d6d98e3ca52b0943c4bd124240574084ffcb1fe4803b85d3d06028",
